---
import Arrow from "./Arrow.astro";
import "../styles/components/studio.css";
---

<section id="studio" class="studio wrap">
  <div class="studio-top">
    <p class="eyebrow">ONE HUMAN. ONE VERY GOOD DOG.</p>
    <span>That's the studio.</span>
  </div>
  <h2>
    Built by a person.<br />Approved by <span class="inline-dog"
      ><img
        src="/brand/logos/dog-coral.svg"
        alt="Melo the golden retriever"
        loading="lazy"
      /></span
    > Melo.
  </h2>
  <div class="studio-body">
    <p class="reveal-words">
      Tiny Melo is my corner of the internet. I'm Christopher, and this is where
      my apps, experiments, and small obsessions find a home.
    </p>
    <div class="studio-aside">
      <p>
        The name belongs to Melo, the golden retriever. The code is mine. The
        laid-back energy is definitely his.
      </p>
      <a
        class="text-link"
        href="https://github.com/tinymelo"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer">See what I'm working on <Arrow /></a>
      <a class="about-preview-link" href="/about"
        >More about the human behind Tiny Melo <Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="melo-portrait">
    <img
      src="/brand/logos/dog-coral.svg"
      alt="Melo, head of taking it easy"
      width="380"
      height="346"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <figcaption>Melo, head of taking it easy.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
